Family_Text_MomSabrina::
	.string "MOM: SABRINA, dear!\n"
	.string "You're always welcome here.\p"
	.string "Your father and the twins' dad\n"
	.string "go back many years.\p"
	.string "You three were always visiting.\n"
	.string "Take care of each other.$"

Family_Text_MomLeafNews::
	.string "MOM: You met up with LEAF!\n"
	.string "How is her team doing?\p"
	.string "She finds time for everyone.\n"
	.string "Learn from each other.\p"
	.string "SABRINA, stay for supper\n"
	.string "whenever you like.$"

Family_Text_MomEightBadges::
	.string "MOM: All eight BADGES!\n"
	.string "You've worked so hard.\p"
	.string "I'll let LEAF know the news.\n"
	.string "Rest before the LEAGUE.$"

Family_Text_MomChampion::
	.string "MOM: KANTO's CHAMPION!\n"
	.string "I'm so proud of you.\p"
	.string "LEAF will want every detail.\n"
	.string "You must be proud, SABRINA.$"

Family_Text_OakStarters::
	.string "OAK: SABRINA! Good to see you.\n"
	.string "How is SAFFRON's GYM LEADER?\p"
	.string "Three months since LEAF left!\n"
	.string "Now her twin is ready, too.\p"
	.string "You've known him for years.\n"
	.string "Let this choice be his own.\p"
	.string "SABRINA: Of course, PROFESSOR.$"

Family_Text_OakPokedex::
	.string "OAK: LEAF stops to observe\n"
	.string "what other TRAINERS miss.\p"
	.string "There is more than one way\n"
	.string "to learn about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "SABRINA, I'm glad an old\n"
	.string "family friend is going along.$"

Family_Text_BlueFirstBattle::
	.string "{RIVAL}: LEAF always stops\n"
	.string "to fuss over her EEVEE.\p"
	.string "You won't catch me taking\n"
	.string "that long between GYMS!\p"
	.string "Brought SABRINA along, huh?\n"
	.string "Then watch me win!$"

Family_Text_Brock::
	.string "BROCK: You're LEAF's brother?\n"
	.string "Her EEVEE earned my respect.\p"
	.string "She fought with patience.\n"
	.string "Show me your own approach.\p"
	.string "SABRINA, welcome to my GYM.$"

Family_Text_Misty::
	.string "MISTY: LEAF mentioned her twin!\n"
	.string "She cares for her team well.\p"
	.string "Her EEVEE fought well.\n"
	.string "Let's see how you battle!\p"
	.string "SABRINA, you came with him?\n"
	.string "Make yourselves at home!$"

Family_Text_SabrinaGymDuty::
	.string "SABRINA: This is my GYM.\n"
	.string "I must take my place inside.\p"
	.string "Our journey does not change\n"
	.string "my duties as GYM LEADER.\p"
	.string "Come to me when you are ready.$"

Family_Text_SabrinaGymChallenge::
	.string "SABRINA: I've seen you grow\n"
	.string "on the road beside me.\p"
	.string "But I grant no favors here.\n"
	.string "Our past won't decide this.\p"
	.string "Your choices will.$"

Family_Text_SabrinaGymRejoin::
	.string "SABRINA: You earned my respect\n"
	.string "as a fellow TRAINER.\p"
	.string "My duty here is fulfilled.\n"
	.string "I'll walk with you again.$"

Family_Text_Erika::
	.string "ERIKA: SABRINA, how lovely.\n"
	.string "Away from your own GYM?\p"
	.string "Your companion has a gentle\n"
	.string "team. This will be pleasant.$"

Family_Text_Giovanni::
	.string "GIOVANNI: SAFFRON's LEADER.\n"
	.string "An unwelcome complication.\p"
	.string "Your powers won't win his fight.\n"
	.string "He must face me himself!$"
